          "save": "basic reflex",
          "description": "<p>Gouts of flame rush from your hands. You deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">12d6</span> fire damage to creatures in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span>.</p>",
